    li "[Charts](wdoc_charts). The other data-driven axis, and the one that _is_ written in WCL. Compare its `lower` with this chapter's two natives."
    li "[Trees, node tables and cards](wdoc_tree). The `card` shape a timeline pins to a date."
    li "[Tilemaps and maps](wdoc_tilemaps). The other blocks that crop an external image into a grid."
    li "[Images, videos and file assets](wdoc_media). How a sprite sheet's path resolves, and where the copy lands."
    li "[Writing your own blocks](wdoc_extending). `lower`, `@native`, and which one a new block of yours should carry."
  }
}
